{"id":"n71456-7-7","stage":1,"title":"나가다 · 上班","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71456-7-7-1","ko":"저분이 다니는 회사는 어디야?","zh":"那位在哪家公司工作啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저분이","meaning":"那；位","explanation":"저：那；분：位；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"},{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저분이","audio":"/audio/eccb9070f304a0d51ffb.mp3"}},{"text":"다니는","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니는","audio":"/audio/dd9ad12ce6de18d5fef5.mp3"}},{"text":"회사는","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사는","audio":"/audio/07eea830806c343675fd.mp3"}},{"text":"어디야?","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디야","audio":"/audio/3d238c840b300c329bff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"位","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"27780","definition":"对人的尊称。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"上班，上学，上","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于职场或学校等地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b0e2fb7ff1155de2d23.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71456-7-7-2","ko":"나도 잘은 모르는데 외국계 회사에 나간다고 들었어.","zh":"我也不太清楚，不过听说他在一家外资企业工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"잘은","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘은","audio":"/audio/3d8a87c569450606215f.mp3"}},{"text":"모르는데","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르는데","audio":"/audio/ee2cc5023edd9bae8925.mp3"}},{"text":"외국계","meaning":"外国","explanation":"외국：外国；계：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"외국","audio":"/audio/6ea4544c8e190594b679.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68121","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"외국계","audio":"/audio/de7efdccb60c9dd969b0.mp3"}},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":